{
  "id": "Lyo.Book.Postgres",
  "name": "Lyo.Book.Postgres",
  "area": "Plugins",
  "tagline": "PostgreSQL and EF Core implementation of `Lyo.Book.IBookStore` (`PostgresBookStore`) via `BookDbContext` and `PostgresBookOptions`.",
  "description": "PostgreSQL and EF Core implementation of `Lyo.Book.IBookStore` (`PostgresBookStore`) via `BookDbContext`, `PostgresBookOptions`, and `AddPostgresMigrations<BookDbContext, PostgresBookOptions>`. Page bodies are raw `text` with a stored generated `tsvector` (English; HTML tags stripped). `PostgresBookStore` implements `Lyo.Health.IHealth`.",
  "features": [
    "**Schema `book`.** Series, books, titles, identifiers, contributors, types, formats, hierarchical genres, chapters, and pages.",
    "**Search.** GIN on generated `search_vector`. `SearchPagesAsync` uses `ts_headline` snippets.",
    "**Constraints.** Catalog-wide unique `(scheme, normalized_value)`; filtered unique primary title/identifier; contributor `(book_id, role, ordinal)`.",
    "**DI.** `AddBookDbContextFactory` / `AddPostgresBookStore` and `FromConfiguration` overloads (section `PostgresBook`).",
    "**Lookups.** `BookDbSeeder` upserts types, formats, and a hierarchical genre tree (idempotent by slug)."
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Registration",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "services.AddPostgresBookStore(o => {\n    o.ConnectionString = connStr;\n    o.EnableAutoMigrations = true;\n});"
    }
  ],
